msgid "Full changelog"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"2.10.0.CR1 introduced a major security issue known as CVE-2022-2466 in the "
"SmallRye GraphQL server extension and all the 2.10.x releases are affected "
"(together with 2.11.0.CR1).\n"
"2.10.3.Final fixes it and the fix will also be included in the upcoming 2.11."
"0.Final.\n"
"You are only affected by this issue if you are exposing GraphQL services."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The context of the requests was not properly terminated and, for a given "
"thread, all further requests would use the context of the first request the "
"thread treated.\n"
"The context includes authentication if your GraphQL services require "
"authentication."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This is an extremely serious issue so we urge anyone who has already "
"upgraded to 2.10.x and is exposing GraphQL services to upgrade to 2.10.3."
"Final."
msgstr ""

msgid "Note that 2.9 and earlier are not affected by the issue."
msgstr ""

msgid "This version also contains some minor additional fixes."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you are not using 2.10 already, please refer to the https://github.com/"
"quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-2.10[2.10 migration guide]."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can get https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/2.10.3."
"Final[the full changelog of 2.10.3.Final on GitHub]."
msgstr ""

